# `vercel --prod` uploads the local working directory, not the git tree (see the
# Deployment Workflow note in CLAUDE.md), so anything sitting in the repo ships
# publicly. Keep internal notes and OS junk out of the deployment.
#
# Deliberately narrow: docs/*.sql are already public and are left that way, and
# nothing here excludes an app file. Verify with a byte-diff after deploying.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.superpowers/
docs/supabase_auth_rls_scope.md
